## Proposed Changes

### Database Setup

#### [NEW] [supabase_vms_and_tenant_tables.sql](file:///f:/TEST%20LIVE%20ATTENDANCE/supabase_vms_and_tenant_tables.sql)
- Creates tables for:
  - `visitors` (id, visitor_code, full_name, photo_url, mobile, email, company_name, government_id_type, government_id_number, vehicle_number, emergency_contact, status, created_at)
  - `visitor_passes` (id, visitor_id, visitor_name, visitor_company, visitor_photo, visitor_mobile, host_employee_id, host_employee_name, host_department, branch_id, branch_name, visit_date, expected_checkin, expected_checkout, purpose, meeting_room, notes, qr_code, approval_status, pass_status, check_in_time, check_out_time, actual_duration, created_at)
  - `visitor_logs` (id, visitor_pass_id, visitor_name, event_type, event_time, method, notes, created_at)
  - `visitor_notifications` (id, visitor_pass_id, employee_id, employee_name, visitor_name, notification_type, message, status, created_at)
  - `visitor_audit_logs` (id, pass_id, action, actor, details, created_at)
- Adds extended columns to `companies` (logo, plan, status, company_code, storage_used, api_usage, renewal_date, contact_email) if not present.
- Creates `branches` table (id, company_id, name, location, timezone, shift, status, created_at) if not present.
- Configures Supabase Realtime publication for VMS and tenant tables.

